From: Wine upstream contributors (see commit list)
Subject: [PATCH] Backport targeted Wine 11.16 fixes.

Squashed backport of 20 WineHQ commits first released in wine-11.16, applied in upstream
order on top of cx26.3-wine11.0-runeon.11 patches 0001-0106. Test-only hunks are omitted.
No production-code adaptation was needed; every commit applied without fuzz.

  0586396004 Nikolay Sivov: oleaut32/typelib: Make it possible to Invoke() through COCLASS type.
  7465fd0aeb Alex Henrie: riched20: Set value to 0 in TextPara_GetAlignment.
  3ddad62c16 Hans Leidekker: crypt32: Support CertGetCertificateContextProperty(CERT_SIGN_HASH_CNG_ALG_PROP_ID).
  2974626684 Alistair Leslie-Hughes: wintrust: Add parameter check in WTHelperGetProvCertFromChain.
  c5f29253cd Tobiasz Laskowski: comctl32/listbox: Fix SetRedraw top item handling.
  d173753872 Tobiasz Laskowski: user32/listbox: Fix SetRedraw top item handling.
  f24946d9fa Nikolay Sivov: comctl32/tab: Ignore negative index TCM_SETCURFOCUS for TCS_BUTTONS controls.
  5c286288d9 Nikolay Sivov: comctl32/tab: Fix switching focus from unset state.
  77369a5940 Nikolay Sivov: comctl32/tab: Update item pressed state on focus change.
  4f2a41bdbe Paul Gofman: winhttp: Support WINHTTP_QUERY_FLAG_NUMBER64 with WINHTTP_QUERY_CONTENT_LENGTH.
  f772f41b72 Henri Verbeet: d3dcompiler_46: Return E_NOINTERFACE from D3DReflect() for unsupported interfaces.
  9ffdbb1f7a Conor McCarthy: wbemdisp: Handle null output pointer in enumvar_Next().
  26d58dbe0e Conor McCarthy: wbemdisp: Add ISWbemObjectPath stub implementation.
  929b2a19cb Conor McCarthy: wbemdisp: Partially implement get ISWbemObjectPath::DisplayName.
  e1ecc5daab Conor McCarthy: wbemdisp: Implement ISWbemObject::GetTypeInfo().
  181b6b984e Conor McCarthy: wbemdisp: Return null object on failure of QueryInterface().
  7bc5e1b9de Tobiasz Laskowski: gdiplus/metafile: Allow drawimage without attributes.
  01e1aeaa3c Stefan Dösinger: wined3d: Don't delay-clear backbuffers except to black.
  8fd185f06b Francisco Casas: wined3d: Don't call vulkan functions with 0 attachments on wined3d_context_vk_update_blend_state().
  d20b224e0b Tobiasz Laskowski: gdiplus/metafile: Fix emf+ image rendering.

